"Barek leaves a hard cheese at the dead oak below the watchtower so the runaways spare his flock."
"Barek has told nobody but Ilse about the cheese, and fears the steward hearing of it."
"Barek half suspects Joss trades with the runaways, and has chosen not to ask."
"Barek would take Rasid's men on as hands if they were pardoned, and claim the credit for it."
